                <p>To access certain features, you must create an account. You agree to provide accurate information, maintain password security, and notify us of unauthorized use.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>3. Student ID</h3>
                <p>Upon successful registration, you will be assigned a unique Student ID in the format <strong>SLC-YYYY-XX-XXX</strong>. This ID is your primary identifier on our platform.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>4. Courses and Learning</h3>
                <p>All courses are provided for educational purposes only. We do not guarantee employment or specific outcomes. You are responsible for your own learning.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>5. User Conduct</h3>
                <p>You agree not to:</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Post offensive or inappropriate content</li>
                    <li>Attempt to cheat on tests or bypass the system</li>
                    <li>Impersonate other users</li>
                    <li>Use the platform for illegal purposes</li>
                    <li>Interfere with platform functionality</li>
                </ul>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>6. Intellectual Property</h3>
                <p>All content on SHINEX Learning Circle is the property of SLC or its licensors. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without permission.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>7. Services</h3>
                <p>Additional services (registration, design, campaigns) are subject to separate pricing and terms. We reserve the right to modify or discontinue any service.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>8. Privacy</h3>
                <p>Please review our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> to understand how we collect and protect your personal information.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>9. Disclaimer of Warranties</h3>
                <p>Our platform is provided "as is" and "as available." We do not warrant that the platform will be uninterrupted or error-free.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>10. Limitation of Liability</h3>
                <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, SLC shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the platform.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>11. Termination</h3>
                <p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account at any time for violation of these terms. You may also delete your account via Settings.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>12. Changes to Terms</h3>
                <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.</p>

                <div class="mobile-terms-divider"></div>

                <h3>13. Contact Information</h3>
                <p>
                    <i class="fas fa-envelope" style="color:var(--primary);"></i> support@shinex.ng<br>
                    <i class="fas fa-phone" style="color:var(--primary);"></i> +234 800 SHINEX<br>
                    <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt" style="color:var(--primary);"></i> Lagos, Nigeria
                </p>
            </div>

            <a href="/" class="mobile-back-link">
                <i class="fas fa-arrow-left"></i> Back to Home
            </a>
        </div>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer-mobile') %>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>